                        "review": "Stars received: 4.6/10 _ Note: v.5 [0.0 to 1] = personal impressions\n\n[0.6] Controls & Training & Help\n[0.3] Menu & Settings\n[0.2] Sound & Music\n[0.4] Graphics\n[0.4] Game Design\n[0.2] Game Story\n[0.5] Game Content\n[0.5] Completion time (level/game)?\n[0.3] is it Enjoyable & Fun?\n[0.2] Could it hold a spot in Favorites? (& if the Game can be repeatedly played again)\n[0] BONUS point: Multi-Player related\n[1] BONUS point: Review for VR\n[N] - if Registration is required with providing PII\n\nGame description key-points: VR puzzle, to match cubes of the colors\n\nOverview:\nsomething is missing, should grab and hold attention! unfortunately willingness to concentrate quickly fades away with this one.\n\nis required attention, perseverance and firm desire to pass each level challenges. game requires time to Think and twist",
